  "text": "Think about opening a shared document. Your device sends a request through networks to the systems providing that service. Computing equipment handles the request, storage holds the information, and a response travels back. The animation follows that sequence. The physical systems underneath stay necessary throughout. Electricity powers the equipment, and cooling removes the heat it produces. A simple action on your device can depend on many connected systems, even though the service hides most of that complexity",
